WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.584
Brad: This is terrible!

2
00:00:04.585 --> 00:00:07.524
Tina: We shouldn’t have left Bello alone!

3
00:00:07.525 --> 00:00:09.961
Danny: We have to chase after him.

4
00:00:09.962 --> 00:00:16.271
Tina: But how? The evil creatures are flying too fast.

5
00:00:16.272 --> 00:00:22.521
Brad: Maybe something in the house can help

6
00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:26.100
us. Look. It’s Bello’s toy car and toy horse.

7
00:00:26.101 --> 00:00:28.257
Danny: How can we use those?

8
00:00:28.258 --> 00:00:30.631
Tina: If only they were real!

9
00:00:30.632 --> 00:00:35.615
Danny: That’s it! They are as real as we can imagine them!

10
00:00:35.616 --> 00:00:38.353
Tina: Do you really think we can make them real?

11
00:00:38.354 --> 00:00:40.061
Danny: It’s worth a try.

12
00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:43.080
Come on, everybody hold hands.

13
00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:48.327
Imagine the fastest horse you can and the quickest car in the world.

14
00:00:48.328 --> 00:01:00.973
Brad: Concentrate with all your might!

15
00:01:00.975 --> 00:01:04.453
Tina: We did it!

16
00:01:04.454 --> 00:01:06.315
Danny: Good work, guys!

17
00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:09.177
Okay, who is going to drive?

18
00:01:09.179 --> 00:01:12.901
Brad: Have you seen me play Race Car Challenge on my computer?

19
00:01:12.902 --> 00:01:18.202
I’m the best! Tina:

20
00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:20.689
I’ve always wanted to ride a horse. Besides

21
00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:23.663
I think she likes me.

22
00:01:23.664 --> 00:01:25.615
Danny: Okay, you ride.

23
00:01:25.616 --> 00:01:28.820
I’ll go with Brad.

24
00:01:28.821 --> 00:01:41.649
Tina: Now let’s go get Bello!

25
00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:44.989
Brad: Wait! Which way did they go?

26
00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.096
Danny: They went that way!

27
00:01:47.098 --> 00:01:49.699
Tina: They went that way!

28
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:55.625
Brad: You two seem a little confused.

29
00:01:55.626 --> 00:01:57.496
Tina: What are you doing?

30
00:01:57.497 --> 00:02:00.150
Brad: I’m using my computer to find Bello.

31
00:02:00.151 --> 00:02:04.995
When we stood in the backyard, Bello’s shadow passed right over the chimney.

32
00:02:04.996 --> 00:02:10.561
That could tell me where they went. Brad:

33
00:02:10.562 --> 00:02:12.782
I’ve got it! I’ll lead. Tina,

34
00:02:12.783 --> 00:02:18.488
you follow me! Danny:

35
00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:22.329
Look out! Brad:

36
00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:28.212
Hold on! Danny:

37
00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:34.116
That was close! Tina:

38
00:02:34.117 --> 00:02:40.215
That’s a good girl! Brad:

39
00:02:40.216 --> 00:02:44.030
Here we go! Tina:

40
00:02:44.031 --> 00:02:54.223
You can do it, girl! Danny:

41
00:02:54.224 --> 00:02:57.558
Look, we’ve almost caught up to them! Brad:

42
00:02:57.559 --> 00:02:59.447
Keep up with me, Tina.

43
00:02:59.448 --> 00:03:02.174
Just a little faster.

44
00:03:02.175 --> 00:03:05.585
Tina: Come on, girl!

45
00:03:05.586 --> 00:03:08.044
Tina: They’re heading toward the mountain.

46
00:03:08.045 --> 00:03:12.520
Brad: We have to keep up with them.

47
00:03:12.521 --> 00:03:19.073
Danny: Rocks! Rocks! Stop!

48
00:03:19.074 --> 00:03:22.568
Tina: We’re stuck!

